Because there are five solutions, it may be desirable to use \"Dashing\" to \
help distinguish the individual curves:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9ba694ef-10d6-4f07-8786-baa9f89cc442"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Plot", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"c1", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", 
